#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-promo.php:479
msgid "Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living"
msgstr "Zinn Hub® — dauki ma'aikatan da suke yin wannan a matsayin sana'a"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-promo.php:480
msgid "Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid."
msgstr "Kasuwancinmu na masu zaman kansu na duniya: bincika ayyuka sama da 10,000 da aka riga aka shirya daga marubuta, masu zanen kaya, masu haɓakawa da ƙwararrun SEO, ko sanya wani aikin kuma bari su yi ciniki."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-style-presets.php:118
msgid "Style preset"
msgstr "Tsarin salo"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-style-presets.php:119
msgid "A starting point. Anything below overrides it."
msgstr "Wani wurin farawa. Duk wani abu da ke ƙasa yana shafe shi."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-style-presets.php:126
msgid "Use my own colours and sizes"
msgstr "Yi amfani da launuka da girmofi na kaina"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-style-presets.php:127
msgid "Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is."
msgstr "Bar wannan a kashe kuma ana amfani da saitaccen tsari yadda yake."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-updater.php:253
msgid "See the Zinn Digital® release notes."
msgstr "Duba bayanan fitowar Zinn Digital®."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-updater.php:302
msgid "The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again."
msgstr "Sabis din sabuntawa na Zinn® bai bayar da hanyar saukarwa don wannan sabuntawar ba. Bincika cewa wannan shafin zai iya isa ga dandalin Zinn®, sannan ka sake gwadawa."

#. translators: %s: the download error reported by WordPress.
#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-updater.php:316
#, php-format
msgid "The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes."
msgstr "Ba a iya saukar da sabuntawar daga sabis na sabuntawa na Zinn® ba (%s). Gwada kuma bayan 'yan mintoci kaɗan."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-updater.php:330
msgid "The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed."
msgstr "Sabuntawar da aka sauke ta gaza gwajin inganci kuma ba a sanya ta ba."

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-ability.php:82
msgid "The action could not be completed. Try again, and if it keeps failing, contact the site administrator."
msgstr "Ba a iya kammala wannan aikin ba. Gwada kuma, idan ya ci gaba da gazawa, tuntuɓi mai gudanar da shafin."

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-rest-bridge.php:281
msgid "A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability's input schema."
msgstr "Ana buƙatar wani abu mai mahimmanci ko kuma yana da siffar da ba daidai ba. Duba tsarin shigar da ikon."

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-rest-bridge.php:314
msgid "The site refused the request."
msgstr "Shafin ya ki amincewa da buƙatar."

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:217
msgid "Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user with an application password and can do only what that user is allowed to do."
msgstr "Bar wa mataimakan AI kamar su Claude, Cursor ko VS Code su yi aiki a kan wannan shafin don ku ta hanyar MCP (Model Context Protocol). Suna shiga azaman mai amfani da WordPress tare da kalmar sirri ta aikace-aikace kuma za su iya yin abin da kawai aka yarda wa wancan mai amfani ya yi."

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:219
msgid "AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them."
msgstr "Wakilan AI suna buƙatar WordPress 6.9 ko kuma wanda ya fi haka. Sabunta WordPress don amfani da su."

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:232
msgid "Connection address (MCP endpoint)"
msgstr "Adireshin haɗi (maƙasudin MCP)"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:235
msgid "Create an application password for your user"
msgstr "Ƙirƙiri kalmar sirri ta aikace-aikace don mai amfani da ku"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:236
msgid "Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:"
msgstr "Ƙara wannan zuwa cikin saitunan MCP na aikace-aikacenka na AI, tare da sunan mai amfani da kuma waccan kalmar sirri:"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:238
msgid "VS Code: put the same entry under \"servers\" in .vscode/mcp.json, not under \"mcpServers\"."
msgstr "VS Code: sanya wannan shigarwa a ƙarƙashin \"servers\" a cikin .vscode/mcp.json, ba a ƙarƙashin \"mcpServers\" ba."

